| `*_ICON_RETRY_DELAY_SEC` | Wrong-icon unlock retry delay (`unlockGuard.js`). |
| `PHOTO_ALBUMS_ACCESS_RETRY_DELAY_SEC` | Access-password fail cooldown (`photoAlbumsAccessFailGuard.js`). |
| `*_ICON_KEYS_MASTER_KEY` | Encrypts cached icon keys / drive tokens (`photoAlbumsMasterKey.js`, `driveTokenCrypto.js`). Rotate: `node ./be/scripts/rotateRecordVaultIconKeysMasterKey.js`. **Secret.** |
| `TEMPKEY_USB` | Temp icon key material (`recordVaultIconKeys.js`, `photoAlbumsIconKeys.js`). **Secret.** |
| `NOTES_MAX_SIZE_UPLOAD_MB` | Note upload cap (`getUploadLimits.js`, `uploadPhoto.js`). |

**TutaPhoto Full Disk Encryption skip** is per-user (UI **Skip Photo Encryption**), stored in `helloworldjunktest.singles.photoalbums_access_password_enabled = false` — not an env flag. **TutaNotes always requires Encrypt Password.**

