## Critical production config

```bash
BY_PASS_SMS_PHONE_VERIFICATION=false
DUPLICATE_PHONE_ALLOW=false
ENABLE_LOGIN_BYPASS=false
BLOCK_MOBILE=true
PUBLIC_LOCKOUT=false
SHOW_MEMBER_CATEGORY=REGULARMEMBER,DEMOUSER,ALLMEMBER
