```

| Variable | Prod | Mac dev | Behavior |
|---|---|---|---|
| `BY_PASS_SMS_PHONE_VERIFICATION` | `false` | `false` | `true` skips SMS verification on signup (`bypassSmsPhoneVerification.js`). |
| `DUPLICATE_PHONE_ALLOW` | `false` | `true` | `true` skips duplicate-phone check (Twilio test mode; `duplicatePhonePolicy.js`). |
| `ENABLE_LOGIN_BYPASS` | `false` | `false` | `true` → passwordless login as `SPECIAL_ID` (`beLoginBypass.js`). **Keep `false` on prod.** |
