| `SHOW_MEMBER_CATEGORY` | — | — | All Singles listing filter (`memberVisibility.js`). Uppercase enum labels; `ALLMEMBER` = alias of `ANYMEMBER`; `REGULARMEMBER` + `ANYMEMBER` always included when list non-empty. |
| `ADMIN_IP` | — | — | Comma list of IPs allowed admin login / impersonation (`adminIpConfig.js`, `adminImpersonate.js`, `beVerifyLoginPassword.js`). Find public IP: `curl -4 ifconfig.me`. |

