## Keep me logged in / session age

```bash
KEEP_ME_LOGIN=7
AUTH_SESSION_MAX_AGE_MS=86400000
```

`KEEP_ME_LOGIN` = days for the checkbox (`authCookie.js`). `AUTH_SESSION_MAX_AGE_MS` = JWT + cookie age when unchecked (`86400000` = 1 day; `604800000` = 7 days; `2592000000` = 30 days).

