DIALOG_HEIGHT_OFFSET=0%
DIALOG_WIDGHT_OFFSET=0%
```

| Variable | Notes |
|---|---|
| `MAIN_FONT` | Site font — also in **`fe/.env`** (`mainFontEnv.js`). Mac: `Algerian, fantasy`. |
| `PHOTO_BROWSER_CACHE_*` | Cache-Control for `GET /api/photo/:id`; max-age used only when `FOREVER=false`. |
| `DEBUG_PHOTO_INFO` | Extra upload/debug UI. |
| `AUTO_UI_CHAT_UPDATE` / `AUTO_UI_POST_UPDATE` | Default `true`; `false` disables background auto-sync. Correct key is **`AUTO_UI_POST_UPDATE`**. |
| `NOTIFICATION_CHAT` / `NOTIFICATION_POST` | Notification feature flags. |
| `DIALOG_*` | Auth dialog tuning; width/margins via `DIALOG_WIDTH_*` / `DIALOG_MARGIN_*` in **`fe/.env`**. |

## Menu visibility by member category

```bash
# Correct (uppercase — what be/mallDepartmentMode.js reads):
ADMIN=show_all
DEMOUSER=show_all
PILOTUSER=show_all
PUBLIC=show_vsingles, show_eMarketPlace
```

Keys must match DB **`singles.member_category`** enum labels in **uppercase**. Prod currently has `Admin=`/`DemoUser=`/`PilotUser=`/`Public=` → ignored (see Known problems).

## Rate limiting

```bash
#BACKEND_RATE_LIMIT_ENABLE=false
#BACKEND_RATE_LIMIT_MAX=150
#BACKEND_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MINUTES=1
FE_RATE_LIMIT_ENABLE=false
FE_RATE_CLIENT_API_ACCESS_LIMIT=100
FE_RATE_CLIENT_API_TIMESLICE_SECONDS=60
FE_RATE_CLIENT_API_COOLDOWN_SECONDS=30
FE_RATE_CLIENT_API_COOLDOWN_ENABLED=true
FE_RATE_CLIENT_API_CONSOLE_LOG=false
```

Backend Express rate-limit is **removed** (`/api/rateLimitStatus` is a stub); if re-enabled use `REDIS_URL` so all workers share one counter. `FE_RATE_*` are mirrored into the Vite bundle (`fe/vite.config.mjs` → `clientApiRateLimitEnv.js`, **not** `fe/.env`): master `FE_RATE_LIMIT_ENABLE` (prod `false`, Mac `true`), per-tab call limit / window / cooldown / sub-switch / console log. After changes: restart Vite (`feall`) on Mac or rebuild FE on prod.

